<section class="wrap">
  <h2>This site</h2>
  <p>
    Built with <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eleventy</a>,
    set in Iowan Old Style with Palatino and Georgia behind it, and themed to
    match the rest of my writing.
    The maps are inlined as SVG rather than linked as images so they take the
    page’s colours — though only the background, station markers and labels
    change with the theme. Line colours are the agencies’ own and are never
    altered.
  </p>
  <p>
    The pipeline is Python and LOOM runs in Docker. Adding a city takes a name,
    a feed URL, and the modes to include{% if site.links.repo %} — the source is
    <a href="{{ site.links.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>{% endif %}.
  </p>
